Added the mobile-first deploy queue to [src/app/pp/page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-035/src/app/pp/page.tsx#L284). The dashboard now renders `DeployQueueCard` and `DeployQueueCards`, fetches enrichment per card, parses AI summaries with the shared `parseAiSummary`, sorts pending requests `production` first then oldest-first, and wires quick approve to the same approve API pattern used on the review page.

The old pending lane list in the “Needs Attention” section was replaced with the new queue at [src/app/pp/page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-035/src/app/pp/page.tsx#L934). Successful quick-approvals now remove the request from local state, decrement `stats.pending`, and show a success toast. Review links go to the company-scoped PP route when a slug is present.

`npx tsc --noEmit` does not pass in this repo because of many unrelated pre-existing TypeScript errors outside this file. I also ran a filtered check against `tsc` output and there were no errors reported for [src/app/pp/page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-035/src/app/pp/page.tsx).
